OL,3,GNEWSATrying Tourette's device was the
OL,4,Abest day of my life
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Katie was just a child, her tics
OL,7,Fwere so relentless they left her
OL,8,Fbedridden with a sore throat for two
OL,9,Fweeks.
OL,11,FThe now 15-year-old says living with
OL,12,FTourette's affected her ability to
OL,13,Fsleep, eat, and caused her to miss
OL,14,Fschool.
OL,16,FBut a wrist device developed by
OL,17,Fresearchers in Nottingham helped her
OL,18,Fcalm down in an "instant".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
