OL,3,GNEWSATrying Tourette's device was the
OL,4,Abest day of my life
OL,5,
OL,6,FKatie recalled trying it on for the
OL,7,Ffirst time, and said: "It was
OL,8,Fabsolutely life-changing. It was like
OL,9,Fthe best day of my life."
